# Approval gate for this repository.
#
# Paired with "Require review from Code Owners" on the main ruleset, this means no pull
# request merges without an approval from a member of the code-owners team. Ownership is
# the whole tree deliberately: the rule is about who signs off, not about which files.
#
# Membership is managed at the org level:
# https://github.com/orgs/base64-annunaki/teams/code-owners
# The team must keep write access — an approval from someone without it does not satisfy
# the requirement, and the PR would sit blocked with an approval showing on it.

*  @base64-annunaki/code-owners
